sequenceDiagram
    participant App as API Server (Node.js)
    participant DB as PostgreSQL
    participant Kafka
    
    App->>DB: BEGIN TRANSACTION
    Note over App,DB: WITH inserted_task AS (<br/>  INSERT INTO project_task... RETURNING *<br/>),<br/>inserted_event AS (<br/>  INSERT INTO outbox_events...<br/>)<br/>SELECT * FROM inserted_task;
    DB-->>App: Return inserted Task
    App->>DB: COMMIT
    
    DB->>DB: Fire pg_notify('outbox_event')
    
    Note right of DB: Outbox Relay wakes up
    DB-->>Kafka: Relay publishes event
